Subject: [PATCH] Line-buffer stdout and stderr for redirected logs

Configure line buffering at startup so output redirected to the UxPlay
log file is flushed after each line. Keep the startup diagnostic.

--- a/uxplay.cpp
+++ b/uxplay.cpp
@@ -2958,6 +2958,10 @@
 #endif
     std::vector<char> server_hw_addr;
     std::string config_file = "";
+    /* Output log when redirected >> /var/log/uxplay.log 2>&1 */
+    setvbuf(stdout, NULL, _IOLBF, BUFSIZ);
+    setvbuf(stderr, NULL, _IOLBF, BUFSIZ);
+    printf("Setting setvbuf\n");
 
 #ifdef _WIN32
     /* initialise Windows kernel qpc frequency for recv timestamping */
